# Dashboard → your agent → Deploy / Integrate → Web Widget → copy the key.
# Agent: "Mandip Sapkota — Portfolio Assistant" (id 252073)
#
# This is a PUBLISHABLE key. It is embedded in the built HTML because the
# widget is a cross-origin iframe keyed by it — the same way a Stripe
# publishable key or a browser-restricted Google Maps key works. It cannot
# be hidden on a static site, so do not treat it as a credential.
#
# Lock it down in the OmniDimension dashboard instead:
#   1. Restrict the widget to mandipsapkota.com.np (+ www) in the agent's
#      allowed-domains setting.
#   2. Keep the per-call duration cap in place (currently 420s) — the agent
#      bills per minute and this widget is publicly reachable.
#
# Leave this unset and the assistant simply does not render. The site
# builds and deploys exactly as it did before.
#
PUBLIC_OMNIDIM_WIDGET_KEY=
